WEBVTT

00:08:58.808 --> 00:09:01.513
In order to write,

00:09:01.513 --> 00:09:05.704
they need to appropriate
the moment of writing

00:09:05.704 --> 00:09:09.155
which is a moment
of extraordinary freedom.

00:09:09.155 --> 00:09:12.098
They have to get into their heads,
search for that bit of freedom

00:09:12.098 --> 00:09:17.124
that can never be taken away
when they write

00:09:17.124 --> 00:09:20.635
and that is also useful
to realize that freedom is possible

00:09:20.635 --> 00:09:22.973
even inside a prison,

00:09:22.973 --> 00:09:28.235
and that the only bars we have
in our wonderful space

00:09:28.235 --> 00:09:30.097
is the word "bars,"